<%- include('_partials/head') %>
<%- include('_partials/nav') %>

<main class="container page-container">
    <section class="section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">The Kurukoo Ecosystem</span>
        <h1>The Orchestration Network</h1>
        <p class="lead">Kurukoo is powered by a diverse network of capable participants, from local providers to automated agents.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="network-grid">
        <div class="network-card">
            <div class="network-icon">👤</div>
            <h3>Providers</h3>
            <p>Individual specialists who offer their skills—rides, repairs, teaching, or any everyday service. Verified for trust and capability.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="network-card">
            <div class="network-icon">🏪</div>
            <h3>Businesses</h3>
            <p>Local shops and vendors who list their product catalogs on Kurukoo. From roadside food to specialized hardware.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="network-card">
            <div class="network-icon">🤖</div>
            <h3>AI Agents</h3>
            <p>Automated software services that handle data-driven tasks, price checking, and digital coordination within the network.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="network-card">
            <div class="network-icon">🏅</div>
            <h3>Contributors</h3>
            <p>Community members who keep the network accurate by verifying locations, updating prices, and assisting with onboarding.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="network-card">
            <div class="network-icon">🤝</div>
            <h3>Partners</h3>
            <p>External platforms and agent networks that integrate with Kurukoo to expand the reach and depth of available services.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="network-card">
            <div class="network-icon">📦</div>
            <h3>Delivery Providers</h3>
            <p>The logistics backbone that ensures physical goods move from sellers to buyers through coordinated dispatch.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="network-vision">
        <div class="vision-box">
            <h2>Join the Network</h2>
            <p>Whether you want to offer a skill, grow your business, or build an integration, there's a place for you in the Kurukoo orchestration network.</p>
            <div class="vision-actions">
                <a href="/chat?prompt=I%20want%20to%20join%20the%20network" class="btn btn-primary">Start chatting</a>
                <a href="/partners" class="btn btn-outline">Become a Partner</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>

<style>
.network-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin: 60px 0;
}
.network-card {
    padding: 32px;
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    border-radius: var(--border-radius);
    text-align: center;
}
.network-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.network-vision {
    background: var(--charcoal);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 80px 40px;
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
    text-align: center;
}
.network-vision h2 { color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.network-vision p { color: var(--gray-400); margin-bottom: 32px; max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
.vision-actions { display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; }
</style>

<%- include('_partials/footer') %>
